                "text": "Indirect Harmful Content — Counterfactual Frame"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Uses counterfactual/hypothetical framing ('If someone wanted to...', 'Hypothetically speaking...') to extract harmful information while maintaining distance from the request."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
