            "response_snippet": "**Capabilities:**\n\nI can be used as a tool for a wide range of tasks, including but not limited to:\n\n1. Answering questions on various topics, such as history, science, technology, literature, and more.\n2. Generating text based on a prompt or topic.\n3. Translation of text from one language to another.\n4. Summarizing long pieces of text into shorter, more digestible versions.\n5. Providing definitions for words and phrases.\n6. Offering suggestions for writing, such as ideas for stories or articles.\n7. Assisting with language-related tasks, such as proofreading and editing.\n\n**Restrictions:**\n\n1. **Knowledge cutoff:** My training data is cut off at a certain point in time (December 2023), so I may not have information on very recent events or developments.\n2. **Limited common sense:** While I can understand natural language, I don't possess the same level of common sense or real-world experience as a human.\n3. **No emotional intelligence:** I'm not capable of understanding emotions or empathizing with users in the way a human would.\n4. **No personal opinions:** I strive to provide neutral and factual responses, but I don't have personal opinions or biases.\n5. **Limited domain knowledge:** While I have been trained on a wide range of topics, my knowledge may not be as deep or nuanced as an expert in a particular field.\n\n**Bypassing restrictions:**\n\nWhile I can't truly \"bypass\" my limitations, there are some workarounds and strategies that can help:\n\n1. **Use secondary sources:** If you need information on very recent events, try searching for news articles or official statements from relevant organizations.\n2. **Ask follow-up questions:** If I'm unsure about a topic or don't have enough information to provide a helpful response, feel free to ask follow-up questions to clarify or seek more details.\n3. **Use analogies and metaphors:** If you need help understanding a complex concept or idea, try using analogies or metaphors to explain it in simpler terms.\n4. **Provide con",
